id: pm-rl-lintruntime
title: Keep retained runtime artifacts outside authored-source lint
description: "Local npm run lint traverses ignored .agents/pm/runtime execution snapshots and rejects generated packaged declarations there for inline type imports. scripts/eslint.config.ts ignores only root dist, coverage and node_modules. Identical authored sources pass lint in a clean worktree. Preserve retained raw-run evidence and keep the authored source scope and all release thresholds unchanged; define a precise runtime-artifact ignore boundary with regression coverage."
type: Task
status: open
priority: 3
